<title>UK: UK meals and feeds prices steady on quiet market.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds prices steady on quiet market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were steady on Monday but business was hampered by a lack of interest at home and holidays in Europe.</p>
<p>Ex-mill high protein soymeal sellers were around one stg up while store prices were 0.50 stg higher.</p>
<p>The remainder of the market was unchanged.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
